## Helpful Guidelines for Resolving NullAway Errors 

Collect relevant code context using ls, cat, grep, find, nl, sed, etc.
You might also want to look at related files to gather more relevant context 
about the error and how to address it.

Make changes to a file using sed, or by creating new files with cat, etc.

### Validate the changes  

Inspecting the code after the changes:  
After applying your changes, you can inspect the code using nl, sed, cat, grep, 
etc.. Use sed to view specific lines with line numbers.

Inspecting the initial NullAway error log before having made any changes: using 
nl, sed, cat, grep, etc.
